      "updated_at": "2017-12-13T12:46:27Z",
      "body": "Hm... it would be easy to deprecate the SendTrig UGen:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSendTrig : UGen {\r\n\t*ar { arg in = 0.0, id = 0, value = 0.0;\r\n\t\t^SendReply.ar(in, '/tr', value, id);\r\n\t}\r\n\t*kr { arg in = 0.0, id = 0, value = 0.0;\r\n\t\t^SendReply.kr(in, '/tr', value, id);\r\n\t}\r\n\t...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nRemoving SendTrig from plugins would break precompiled SynthDefs and probably other clients, but this would avoid the present crash.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
